The EVM pool

A port of Privacy Pools v1 core with no keys: no Entrypoint, no owner, no proxy, no setter, no pause.

Source: https://github.com/0xbow-io/privacy-pools-core, tag v1.3.0, commit c312dcd58f6ad085204be61923c49f8065e4e9ae,
packages/contracts/. Apache License 2.0, "Copyright 2025 0XBOW LTD" (the source's LICENSE, line 189). The Apache
License 2.0 text is this repository's LICENSE file. The source has no NOTICE file. Each ported file keeps its licence
header and says what changed. The setup files the verifiers hold are the ones in packages/kit/zk (same commit).

Files, against the source's packages/contracts/src/:

  src/State.sol                  contracts/State.sol, changed (below)
  src/PrivacyPool.sol            contracts/PrivacyPool.sol, changed, with the deposit and relay checks of
                                 contracts/Entrypoint.sol
  src/PrivacyPoolSimple.sol      contracts/implementations/PrivacyPoolSimple.sol: no Entrypoint argument
  src/interfaces/IState.sol      interfaces/IState.sol, changed to match
  src/interfaces/IPrivacyPool.sol interfaces/IPrivacyPool.sol, changed to match
  src/interfaces/IVerifier.sol   interfaces/IVerifier.sol, unchanged
  src/lib/Constants.sol          contracts/lib/Constants.sol, unchanged
  src/lib/ProofLib.sol           contracts/lib/ProofLib.sol, unchanged
